{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12387","headline":"送王相公赴范阳 · 钱起","name":"送王相公赴范阳","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"翊圣衔恩重，频年按节行。\n安危皆报国，文武不缘名。\n受脤乃调鼎，爲霖更洗兵。\n幕开丞相阁，旗总贰师营。\n料敌知无战，安边示有征。\n代云横马首，燕雁拂笳声。\n去镇关河静，归看日月明。\n欲知瞻恋切，迟暮一书生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12387.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12387","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}